  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In an ac generator, a rectangular coil of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> turns each having area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is rotated at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rev</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> about an axis perpendicular to a uniform magnetic field of magnitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>. The maximum value of the emf produced will be ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p>[Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1584",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Maximum value of induced EMF can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#958;</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>360</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1584</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
  }
